1
00:00:23,776 --> 00:00:28,515
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:32,227
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,451 --> 00:00:34,696
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,043 --> 00:00:37,750
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,629 --> 00:00:43,157
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:46,789
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:50,755
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,899 --> 00:00:55,395
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,395 --> 00:01:00,035
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:02,083
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:08,035
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,227 --> 00:01:11,915
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,915 --> 00:01:15,486
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,651 --> 00:01:22,595
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,043 --> 00:01:26,664
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,664 --> 00:01:30,348
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,435 --> 00:01:35,363
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,363 --> 00:01:39,523
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,267 --> 00:01:46,819
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,363 --> 00:01:50,019
=Episode 13=

21
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,200
Miss Jiang.

22
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:07,239
Miss Jiang, are you all right?

23
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:09,400
I wanted to ask you something,

24
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:11,120
but you left in a hurry.

25
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,560
Luckily I followed you.

26
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,439
None of your business.

27
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:18,439
I know you still resent me.

28
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:21,376
I don't expect you to forgive me,

29
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:26,319
but I don't want you to be hurt again.

30
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,919
Do you know this person?

31
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:36,439
Judging from his tattoo,
he must be from Xiaosheng Society.

32
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:39,680
It isn't safe here.

33
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,039
Let's talk later.

34
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:48,680
The person in this photo is my mother.

35
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:51,080
How did you get this photo?

36
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:56,639
The kingfisher phoenix crown
your mother was wearing in the photo,

37
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,120
do you know where it is now?

38
00:02:58,319 --> 00:02:59,960
You haven't answered my question yet.

39
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,599
Forget it.

40
00:03:04,719 --> 00:03:07,159
It seems you still want to deceive me.

41
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:12,520
I found this photo
among Master's old belongings.

42
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,319
My mother passed away very early.

43
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:19,800
Are you saying
that Head Rong knew my mother?

44
00:03:24,159 --> 00:03:27,560
Then this person in the photo
is Head Rong?

45
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,319
At that time,

46
00:03:34,159 --> 00:03:36,360
Master should still
be called Zhao Shengge.

47
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:45,280
Are you saying that Head Rong
was the murderer of Xu You'an's mother?

48
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,360
No way.

49
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:49,360
Master would never
be a villain who took lives.

50
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,879
Something must be hidden
about what happened eight years ago.

51
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,360
Does Xu You'an know?

52
00:03:58,879 --> 00:03:59,680
No way.

53
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,319
I need to go tell Xu You'an.

54
00:04:02,919 --> 00:04:03,719
Miss Jiang,

55
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,840
we must not let him know
until the matter is clarified.

56
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,199
You know his temperament.

57
00:04:08,719 --> 00:04:10,520
I won't hide it from him with you.

58
00:04:10,919 --> 00:04:14,439
Because I know how terrible
the feeling of being deceived is.

59
00:04:15,039 --> 00:04:16,439
I'm not trying to deceive him.

60
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:20,160
Once I find out the truth,
I will tell him everything.

61
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:23,480
With the kingfisher phoenix crown,
perhaps I can see the truth back then.

62
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:29,160
Rong Xiaonan, why did you deceive me?

63
00:04:29,839 --> 00:04:31,079
Xu You'an, calm down.

64
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:33,879
Master would never
commit such a heinous crime.

65
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:35,879
I will dig out all the truth.

66
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,920
The case from eight years ago
has solid evidence.

67
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,680
He faked his death to escape punishment.

68
00:04:41,319 --> 00:04:43,079
What are you defending him for?

69
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:46,399
Give me some time.

70
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,720
Once I find out the truth,

71
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:51,160
proving that he truly did wrong,

72
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,800
then I shall

73
00:04:53,439 --> 00:04:55,160
atone for his sins.

74
00:04:55,639 --> 00:04:56,480
Atone for his sins?

75
00:04:57,839 --> 00:04:59,720
You reminded me.

76
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:06,879
Then you shall atone for his sins.

77
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:08,759
If you doubt me,

78
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:12,240
then you can shoot me
to death right now.

79
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,480
You made it sound reasonable.

80
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:16,199
But the truth you mentioned

81
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:19,279
is nothing but an excuse
to clear your master.

82
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:25,000
Since you want an explanation,

83
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,720
okay then.

84
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:32,720
Now kneel down to atone
and apologize to me.

85
00:05:35,759 --> 00:05:37,199
I said kneel!

86
00:05:40,079 --> 00:05:40,920
Kneel!

87
00:05:56,079 --> 00:05:56,879
Xu You'an.

88
00:05:57,399 --> 00:05:58,800
Xu You'an, calm down.

89
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,279
Calm down.

90
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:17,000
I won't cooperate with someone
as selfish and disgusting as you.

91
00:06:17,839 --> 00:06:19,040
From now on,

92
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,720
my matters with Chun'er
are none of your business.

93
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:26,680
Now get out of the Governor Mansion!

94
00:06:44,399 --> 00:06:46,624
The kingfisher phoenix crown
is in the hidden compartment

95
00:06:46,624 --> 00:06:48,279
of my father's room.

96
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:50,120
You saved me.

97
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:52,360
I repay this to you.

98
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:54,399
From now on, we are even.

99
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:12,560
I didn't expect
you would come to this day.

100
00:07:17,439 --> 00:07:20,920
Mr. Du, why mock me?

101
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:25,560
Since you are here,
you must come for a cooperation.

102
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:27,480
Why not get to the point?

103
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,759
Get to the point?

104
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:29,959
Cooperation?

105
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,888
If it weren't for the fact
that I haven't obtained the items,

106
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:36,759
I would blow up
your Governor Mansion right now

107
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,680
and send you and your son to death.

108
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:45,759
How about we cooperate
and send Xu You'an to death?

109
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:48,759
Then the previous deal can continue.

110
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:55,199
You are now like a fish
waiting to be slaughtered.

111
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,560
Why would I cooperate with you?

112
00:07:59,079 --> 00:08:00,879
The phoenix crown
is in the Jiang residence.

113
00:08:00,879 --> 00:08:04,240
We can discuss cooperation
after you get the crown.

114
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:08,560
This is my sincerity.

115
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:12,879
Okay.

116
00:08:59,159 --> 00:08:59,879
Who are you?

117
00:08:59,879 --> 00:09:01,159
Search this place thoroughly

118
00:09:01,159 --> 00:09:02,559
to find the phoenix crown!

119
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:03,679
- Yes!
- Yes!

120
00:09:05,879 --> 00:09:06,679
This...

121
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:12,639
(Rongqing Troupe)
Kill him!

122
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:15,480
Move aside!

123
00:09:15,799 --> 00:09:16,600
Move aside!

124
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,720
What are you doing?

125
00:09:17,799 --> 00:09:18,559
Stop!

126
00:09:18,559 --> 00:09:19,279
Stop!

127
00:09:21,759 --> 00:09:23,399
He is that scum's disciple!

128
00:09:23,639 --> 00:09:24,720
Zhao Shengge is dead.

129
00:09:24,799 --> 00:09:26,639
We can kill him to seek revenge.

130
00:09:26,679 --> 00:09:27,519
Kill him!

131
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:28,879
Kill him!

132
00:09:28,879 --> 00:09:29,720
Kill him!

133
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:33,240
(How did they know
that Master is Zhao Shengge?)

134
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,960
Kill him!

135
00:09:35,679 --> 00:09:38,960
Wait!

136
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:43,240
Killing him would be too lenient.

137
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:47,080
Since you want us
to spare the Rongqing Troupe,

138
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:49,279
why not sing a piece for us?

139
00:09:49,639 --> 00:09:51,399
If you please us all,

140
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:53,200
we'll spare you. How about it?

141
00:09:53,759 --> 00:10:00,240
- Sing a piece!
- Sing a piece!

142
00:10:01,559 --> 00:10:03,159
What do you mean?

143
00:10:04,759 --> 00:10:06,200
You can't sing without makeup?

144
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,159
Fine.

145
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,600
I'll help you then.

146
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:10,840
I'll help you.

147
00:10:11,519 --> 00:10:12,320
Beat him to death!

148
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:16,759
You lowly performer!

149
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:18,559
Beat him to death!

150
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:19,879
Governor is here.

151
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:30,200
Let's go.

152
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,159
Governor has left.

153
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,120
Beat him!

154
00:10:38,519 --> 00:10:40,399
I wonder who leaked the news.

155
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:41,879
Governor,

156
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:44,440
are we really going
to leave Rong Xiaonan alone?

157
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,200
Beat him to death!

158
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,679
You lowly performer!

159
00:10:52,679 --> 00:10:53,600
You lowly performer!

160
00:10:53,799 --> 00:10:54,600
He deserves to die!

161
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,759
Let's go.

162
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,000
Let's go.

163
00:11:06,639 --> 00:11:09,399
By the way,
a servant from the Jiang family said

164
00:11:09,399 --> 00:11:12,519
that the Xiaosheng Society sent people
to make a scene in the Jiang residence.

165
00:11:12,519 --> 00:11:13,960
Do we send someone to check?

166
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:20,559
Does the Xiaosheng Society know
the crown is in the Jiang residence?

167
00:11:23,879 --> 00:11:24,720
To the Jiang residence.

168
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:26,848
(Rongqing Troupe)

169
00:11:26,848 --> 00:11:29,216
(Peerless Beauty And Grace)

170
00:11:42,559 --> 00:11:44,440
(Only by first clarifying the truth,)

171
00:11:45,639 --> 00:11:49,799
(can I find a way
to prove Master's innocence.)

172
00:12:53,919 --> 00:12:56,440
Why did you mistakenly abduct
the sister of a military officer?

173
00:12:57,519 --> 00:12:59,200
Now they are conducting
a massive search,

174
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:02,480
we can't keep these goods.

175
00:13:05,159 --> 00:13:07,159
We need to think of a way
to cover it up,

176
00:13:07,559 --> 00:13:10,480
otherwise, trouble will come to us.

177
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:15,320
Zhao Shengge just came to us.

178
00:13:15,759 --> 00:13:19,720
And your Madam Gu knows too much.

179
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:22,000
She can't be left alive.

180
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:23,919
Rest assured.

181
00:13:24,279 --> 00:13:25,759
I've already taken care of her.

182
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:36,200
Xu Fan and President Jiang are culprits
of the murder case back then.

183
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:58,560
♪As if it were fate♪

184
00:13:58,560 --> 00:13:59,917
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

185
00:14:00,479 --> 00:14:03,716
♪We miss each other♪

186
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:06,528
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

187
00:14:06,528 --> 00:14:08,928
♪And a bizarre♪

188
00:14:08,928 --> 00:14:11,730
♪Anonymous legend♪

189
00:14:12,260 --> 00:14:14,272
♪The plot twists and turns♪

190
00:14:14,420 --> 00:14:16,160
♪Play out over and over again♪

191
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:19,224
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

192
00:14:19,805 --> 00:14:21,504
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

193
00:14:21,504 --> 00:14:22,496
♪Refuse to submit♪

194
00:14:22,496 --> 00:14:25,696
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

195
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:30,272
♪There are always too many♪

196
00:14:30,272 --> 00:14:32,160
♪Helpless situations♪

197
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:34,784
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

198
00:14:35,915 --> 00:14:37,875
♪Even if I have questions♪

199
00:14:37,875 --> 00:14:39,875
♪I harbor desires♪

200
00:14:39,875 --> 00:14:42,752
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

201
00:14:43,103 --> 00:14:44,736
♪People come and go♪

202
00:14:44,736 --> 00:14:47,552
♪I'm still all alone♪

203
00:14:47,552 --> 00:14:50,280
♪Wandering around♪

204
00:14:50,528 --> 00:14:53,381
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

205
00:14:53,381 --> 00:14:57,842
♪Go through the entanglement♪

206
00:14:58,208 --> 00:14:59,936
♪If longing♪

207
00:14:59,936 --> 00:15:03,095
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

208
00:15:03,095 --> 00:15:05,850
♪How can I be at ease♪

209
00:15:05,952 --> 00:15:08,266
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

210
00:15:08,384 --> 00:15:10,240
♪And travelled around the world♪

211
00:15:10,336 --> 00:15:13,424
♪Scars all over me♪

212
00:15:13,696 --> 00:15:16,608
♪If longing never fades♪

213
00:15:16,608 --> 00:15:18,057
♪Burns still hot♪

214
00:15:18,057 --> 00:15:21,136
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

215
00:15:21,408 --> 00:15:23,265
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

216
00:15:23,328 --> 00:15:24,512
♪In the next life♪

217
00:15:24,512 --> 00:15:28,992
♪Entangle with you again♪
